    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that the escape prefix (\"$$\") prevents variable substitution, leaving the literal \"${varName}\" in the output instead of resolving it. <p>StringSubstitutor uses \"$${...}\" to produce a literal \"${...}\" in output. The first \"$\" is the escape character; the second begins what looks like a variable reference, but the whole expression is output verbatim without looking up the variable's value.</p>"
   },
